OL,3,GNEWSAQuestions hang over crumbling
OL,4,Atheatre reopening
OL,5,
OL,6,FA reopening date for an unsafe Surrey
OL,7,Ftheatre is yet to be confirmed,
OL,8,Faccording to the Local Democracy
OL,9,FReporting Service (LDRS).
OL,11,FHarlequin Theatre in Redhill was closed
OL,12,Fin 2023 after it was found to be
OL,13,Friddled with dangerous reinforced
OL,14,Fautoclaved aerated concrete (Raac).
OL,16,FThe earliest hoped-for reopening has
OL,17,Fbeen 2028 but the leader of Reigate and
OL,18,FBanstead Borough Council (RBBC) has
OL,19,Fsaid it depends on how long the
OL,20,Foperator's fit-out work takes once the
OL,21,Fbuilding has been made safe.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
