OL,3,GNEWSAQuestions hang over crumbling
OL,4,Atheatre reopening
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarly estimates said emergency repairs
OL,7,Fand modernisation - which have yet to
OL,8,Fbegin - would last six to seven months,
OL,9,Fbut this has now doubled to between 12
OL,10,Fand 15 months.
